  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Policies designed and implemented to extend social protection coverage and to strengthen the financial governance of social protection</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO is providing comprehensive technical assistance to the National Insurance Board of Saint Vincent and the Grenadines to strengthen the country&#x2019;s social protection system. This includes conducting the 13th Actuarial Valuation of the National Insurance Fund to assess its financial health and sustainability, and undertaking a feasibility study for establishing a permanent Unemployment Insurance scheme. The initiative aims to support evidence-based policy decisions that enhance the resilience, inclusivity, and long-term viability of the national social security framework.</narrative>
  </description>
